{
  "name": "Editable Gantt",
  "description": "A beautifully simple, editable Gantt chart. Plan and update project timelines directly on the sheet: drag bars to reschedule, resize to change duration, link dependencies, track progress and milestones. Optionally drive it from your data model.",
